<mxCell id="c50" value="getAllCustomers() returns the repository list directly (no copy). Search routes are exact-match, case-sensitive lookups: findByFirstName (derived query) and findByJobTitleJPQL (@Query on jobTitle).&#10;A missing id raises CustomerNotFoundException; the @RestControllerAdvice maps it to 404 with an ErrorResponse body (message + timestamp)." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica Neue;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1A1B1C;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
